WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.583
The arrows in the bar go to the previous or the next chapter.

2
00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:08.455
At the end of the chapter, the card goes to the next one.

3
00:00:08.455 --> 00:00:12.777
